===Pronunciation===
{{pt-IPA|temêr}}
* {{hyphenation|pt|te|mer}}

===Verb===
{{pt-verb}}

# {{lb|pt|intransitive|transitive}} to [[fear]] {{gloss|to feel fear about something}}
#: {{syn|pt|[[ter]] [[medo]] ([[de]])}}
#: {{ant|pt|destemer}}
#: {{uxi|pt|Não '''tema'''!|Don’t '''be afraid'''!}}
#: {{ux|pt|Eu '''temo''' o dia em que ninguém more mais aqui.|I '''fear''' the day no one lives here any more.}}
# {{indtr|pt|a|.chiefly|.religion}} to [[fear]] {{gloss|to feel awe towards}}
#: {{ux|pt|Todo bom cristão '''teme''' a Deus.|Every good Christian '''fears''' God.}}
